{"id":"tobiah","name":"Tobiah","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:tobiah"],"groups":["2. An enemy of the Jews in the time of Nehemiah"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Tobiah","text":"Pleasing to Jehovah, the “servant,” the “Ammonite,” who joined with those who opposed the rebuilding of Jerusalem after the Exile (Neh. 2:10). He was a man of great influence, which he exerted in opposition to the Jews, and “sent letters” to Nehemiah “to put him in fear” (Neh. 6:17-19). “Eliashib the priest” prepared for him during Nehemiah’s absence “a chamber in the courts of the house of God,” which on his return grieved Nehemiah sore, and therefore he “cast forth all the household stuff of Tobiah out of the chamber” (13:7, 8)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2900","lemma":"טוֹבִיָּה","xlit":"Ṭôwbîyâh","gloss":"Tobijah, the name of three Israelites and of one Samaritan","kjv":"Tobiah, Tobijah","count":14,"share":0.47},{"strong":"H107","lemma":"אִגֶּרֶת","xlit":"ʼiggereth","gloss":"an epistle","kjv":"letter","count":3,"share":0.1},{"strong":"H3957","lemma":"לִשְׁכָּה","xlit":"lishkâh","gloss":"a room in a building","kjv":"chamber, parlour","count":4,"share":0.13},{"strong":"H2346","lemma":"חוֹמָה","xlit":"chôwmâh","gloss":"a wall of protection","kjv":"wall, walled","count":4,"share":0.13},{"strong":"H3162","lemma":"יַחַד","xlit":"yachad","gloss":"a unit","kjv":"alike, at all, both, likewise","count":3,"share":0.1},{"strong":"H7971","lemma":"שָׁלַח","xlit":"shâlach","gloss":"to send away, for, or out","kjv":"any wise, appoint, bring, cast","count":7,"share":0.23}],"verses":["Ezra.2.60","Neh.2.10","Neh.2.19","Neh.4.3","Neh.4.7","Neh.6.1","Neh.6.12","Neh.6.14","Neh.6.17","Neh.6.19","Neh.7.62","Neh.13.4","Neh.13.7","Neh.13.8","Neh.4.8","Neh.6.2","Neh.6.3","Neh.6.4","Neh.6.5","Neh.6.6","Neh.6.7","Neh.6.8","Neh.6.9","Neh.6.10","Neh.6.11","Neh.6.13","Neh.6.18","Neh.13.5","Neh.13.6","Neh.13.9"],"related":[{"id":"geshem","type":"cooccur","shared":7,"jaccard":0.233,"why":